<title>CHINA: Arnhold opens HK, Beijing retail outlets.</title>
<headline>Arnhold opens HK, Beijing retail outlets.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bathroom fixtures and fittings supplier Arnhold Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it has launched retail outlets in Beijing and Hong Kong in cooperation with Kohler Co of the United States.</p>
<p>The shops, Arnhold's first foray into the retail market, are aimed at the very top of the market and involved investment of US$14 million, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
